{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-1ou.2.1:000012:note_appended:sase-1ou.2.1.1:b18fb5a32504bb0dc1a17fde9aa740c95cce183b6c3d72109131d5fee9a13e41","timestamp":"2026-10-27T16:04:33Z","actor":"sase-1ou.2.1.1","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"sase-1ou.2.1.1","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"Rust store contention policy landed in sase-core: skip redundant schema writes on current stores (version + child columns + required tables), bounded BusyBudget retry with 25ms sqlite slices, persist-WAL + NO_CKPT_ON_CLOSE, retention FS after commit, PyO3 ToolRun defaults pass 0. just test -p sase_core tool_run::store 138 pass; just test -p sase_core_py timeout 2 pass; epic-symbols clean. sase tool run 368488858077809ada7e7a75e54808a6 failed only on known flake sase-1gz (gateway listener_creates_private_socket). Default remains 250ms. Pin ratchet left to caller-integration. Did not close parent sase-1ou.2.1 / sase-1ou.2 / sase-18t."}}
